                     Floppy Installation

 P. 233, Using DESQview with a Floppy-Based System:

   Due to the extra features that have been added to DESQview 386,
   the disk space requirements have grown to approximately 5
   megabytes. This means that you will not be able to install
   DESQview 386 to a floppy-based system.

   DESQview may be installed to a floppy-based system that uses
   high density drives (1.2 megabytes or greater). To do so, follow
   the instructions in the manual.

   You will not be able to install DESQview to a system that is
   equipped with only 360K or 720K floppy drives.
